{
  "type": "minecraft:chest",
  "pools": [
    {
      "rolls": 1,
      "entries": [
        {
          "type": "minecraft:item",
          "name": "minecraft:written_book",
          "modifier": [
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_book_cover",
              "title": {
                "raw": "Sand Keeps Time"
              },
              "author": "Talia, treasure hunter",
              "generation": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_written_book_pages",
              "mode": "replace_all",
              "pages": [
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "Day 1. A temple in the desert. Blue clay in the floor, shaped like an eye. I knew the treasure was under it.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "I broke the eye and fell. The treasure was there. So was the dark. The walls were too smooth to climb.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "Day 6. Gold and diamonds, and no bread. I'd trade every gem for one loaf.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "Sand trickles from the cracks, slow as a clock. I think it's counting for me.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "minecraft:item",
          "name": "minecraft:written_book",
          "modifier": [
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_book_cover",
              "title": {
                "raw": "Three Skulls"
              },
              "author": "Corin",
              "generation": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_written_book_pages",
              "mode": "replace_all",
              "pages": [
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "Three skulls. Four blocks of soul sand. I set the last skull, and the sky went black.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "It had three heads, and all of them hated me. My sword was a twig. My armor was paper.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "I thought I was a hero. I was only the one who woke it. I'm sorry, everyone who lived nearby.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "minecraft:item",
          "name": "minecraft:written_book",
          "modifier": [
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_book_cover",
              "title": {
                "raw": "Bait"
              },
              "author": "Edda, miner",
              "generation": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_written_book_pages",
              "mode": "replace_all",
              "pages": [
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "Diamonds! Four of them, shining at the bottom of the cave. I swung my pick, and the floor gave way.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "It wasn't water underneath. It was orange, and loud, and very warm.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "If you see diamonds next to lava, leave them. They're bait. They were always bait.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "minecraft:item",
          "name": "minecraft:written_book",
          "modifier": [
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_book_cover",
              "title": {
                "raw": "Something Listening"
              },
              "author": "Pell",
              "generation": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_written_book_pages",
              "mode": "replace_all",
              "pages": [
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "Deep down, the stone turns blue and breathes. Something under it was listening.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "I crept. I crouched. I held my breath. Then a little shrieker screamed, and the ground began to shake.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "It had no eyes. It didn't need them. It heard my heart, and followed the sound.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "minecraft:item",
          "name": "minecraft:written_book",
          "modifier": [
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_book_cover",
              "title": {
                "raw": "A Soft Hiss"
              },
              "author": "Bram, farmer",
              "generation": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_written_book_pages",
              "mode": "replace_all",
              "pages": [
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "I built my house with my own hands. Oak walls, a glass window, a field of wheat.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "I was looking at my wheat when I heard it. A soft little hiss, right behind me.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "I never turned around. I'm glad. I don't think I wanted to see it smile.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "minecraft:item",
          "name": "minecraft:written_book",
          "modifier": [
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_book_cover",
              "title": {
                "raw": "Go To Bed"
              },
              "author": "Lio",
              "generation": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_written_book_pages",
              "mode": "replace_all",
              "pages": [
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "Three nights without sleep. There was always one more tunnel, one more ore.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "On the fourth night the sky grew wings. They screamed as they dove, blue and torn and endless.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "If you're reading this, go to bed. Please. Just go to bed.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "minecraft:item",
          "name": "minecraft:written_book",
          "modifier": [
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_book_cover",
              "title": {
                "raw": "Under Me, Stars"
              },
              "author": "Saro",
              "generation": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_written_book_pages",
              "mode": "replace_all",
              "pages": [
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "I beat the dragon. I stood at the edge of the world and laughed.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "An enderman stared at me, and I stepped back to get a better look.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "There was no ground. Only stars, above me and below me, and a long, quiet fall. It was almost pretty.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "minecraft:item",
          "name": "minecraft:written_book",
          "modifier": [
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_book_cover",
              "title": {
                "raw": "Wear The Gold"
              },
              "author": "Fenna",
              "generation": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_written_book_pages",
              "mode": "replace_all",
              "pages": [
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "Note to self: the pig folk like gold. I left my gold boots by the portal.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "They did not like that. There were very many of them, and they were very fast.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "Wear the gold. Even if it looks silly. Especially then.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "minecraft:item",
          "name": "minecraft:written_book",
          "modifier": [
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_book_cover",
              "title": {
                "raw": "A Bed In The Nether"
              },
              "author": "Ivo",
              "generation": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_written_book_pages",
              "mode": "replace_all",
              "pages": [
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "It was late, and home was far. I thought: I'll just sleep here, in my red bed.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "The bed did not agree.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "My last thought was how pretty the blast looked against the netherrack. Silly, what you think about.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "minecraft:item",
          "name": "minecraft:written_book",
          "modifier": [
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_book_cover",
              "title": {
                "raw": "Green Light"
              },
              "author": "Marin, diver",
              "generation": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_written_book_pages",
              "mode": "replace_all",
              "pages": [
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "The sea temple glowed green under the waves. I took a deep breath and swam down.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "A great fish watched me with its one eye. My arms grew heavy. My breath ran out.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "The light from the surface looked so close. It wasn't.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "minecraft:item",
          "name": "minecraft:written_book",
          "modifier": [
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_book_cover",
              "title": {
                "raw": "The Gate"
              },
              "author": "Hollis",
              "generation": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_written_book_pages",
              "mode": "replace_all",
              "pages": [
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "I drank the dark bottle the captain dropped. I thought it was a prize.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "That night the bells rang and the villagers ran. The raiders came with axes and banners.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "I held the gate as long as I could. The villagers lived. I didn't. That seems fair.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "minecraft:item",
          "name": "minecraft:written_book",
          "modifier": [
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_book_cover",
              "title": {
                "raw": "So Soft"
              },
              "author": "Nel",
              "generation": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_written_book_pages",
              "mode": "replace_all",
              "pages": [
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "Fresh snow on the mountain. So soft. So white.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "I stepped in and kept sinking. It wasn't snow. It was powder, and it was very cold.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "I could see the sun the whole time. It just wasn't warm enough.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "minecraft:item",
          "name": "minecraft:written_book",
          "modifier": [
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_book_cover",
              "title": {
                "raw": "For A Second"
              },
              "author": "Aya",
              "generation": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_written_book_pages",
              "mode": "replace_all",
              "pages": [
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "Wings! I found wings on a ship at the end of the world. I flew over oceans and mountains.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "I went faster, and faster. The cliff came up faster than that.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "For a second, I really was flying.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "minecraft:item",
          "name": "minecraft:written_book",
          "modifier": [
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_book_cover",
              "title": {
                "raw": "Small Blue Spiders"
              },
              "author": "Tam",
              "generation": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_written_book_pages",
              "mode": "replace_all",
              "pages": [
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "An old mineshaft, full of rails and cobwebs. I followed the rails down.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "The webs got thicker. Small blue spiders poured out of a cage. Then more. Then more.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "I feel sick and everything looks green. There's a minecart here. I think I'll sit in it a while.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "minecraft:item",
          "name": "minecraft:written_book",
          "modifier": [
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_book_cover",
              "title": {
                "raw": "The Cat Is Patient"
              },
              "author": "Mabel",
              "generation": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "minecraft:set_written_book_pages",
              "mode": "replace_all",
              "pages": [
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "I lived a long time in my little house by the river. A cat, a garden, a good view.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "One night I lay down and didn't get up. I wasn't scared. I thought I'd see the river again.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "raw": {
                    "text": "But the river is dry and the line is long. I'm still waiting, my cat in my arms. He's patient. So am I.",
                    "color": "#2a1f33"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "random_sequence": "deathbound:journal"
}
